    "html": "<p>The distance between two point charges <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q_{A}\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q_{B}\"></span> is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.0\"></span> m. The charge of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q_{A}\"></span> is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4.0 \\times 10^{-6}\"></span> C and the charge of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q_{B}\"></span> is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.0 \\times 10^{-6}\"></span> C. What is the electric field due to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q_{B}\"></span> at the position of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q_{A}\"></span> and what is the electric force exerted by <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q_{A}\"></span> on <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q_{B}\"></span>?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Electric field due to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q_{B}\"></span> at the position of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q_{A}\"></span></strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Electric force exerted by <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q_{A}\"></span> on <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q_{B}\"></span></strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"18\"></span> kN C<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"72\"></span> kN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"36\"></span> kN C<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"72\"></span> kN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"18\"></span> kN C<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"72\"></span> mN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"36\"></span> kN C<span class=\"math\" 